## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
##+Q 65536

## Tweak GC to run more often
##-env ERL_FULLSWEEP_AFTER 10

## Enable deployment without epmd
## (requires changing both vm.args and remote.vm.args)
-start_epmd false -epmd_module Elixir.XPForge.EPMD

## Reserve stdout for the LSP protocol, sending every other write to stderr.
## `-user` is undocumented: it makes `user_sup` call `Elixir.XPExpert.StdioRedirect.start/0`
## instead of starting `user_drv` itself. Must come AFTER any -noshell/-noinput/-oldshell,
## as `user_sup:check_flags/3` keeps only the last of them.
-user Elixir.XPExpert.StdioRedirect
